wiring_request = "Domain 4 (launchpad deployment), DELIVERY_CONFIG_FILE consumed by services/launchpad/trading-charts/internal/config: bind chartOutbox={stream:<admitted output JetStream>,subject:candle.updated.v2,batch:1..64,intervalMillis:10..10000}, admit candle.updated.v2 in policy.subjects, and provision that stream/subject and publisher ACL in the deployment inventory."
